# Newest entries first. The version-release must match the spec.

* Fri Sep 11 2026 van-ess0 <https://github.com/van-ess0> 0.2.1-1
- Uses less battery: ongoing games are only polled while one waits for the
  opponent, and less often while nothing changes. The cover clock only
  updates while the cover is shown.
- Fewer requests at startup.
- Logging out waits until Lichess has revoked the login, and says so if it
  could not.
- Invalid positions from the server are rejected instead of crashing.

* Fri Sep 11 2026 van-ess0 <https://github.com/van-ess0> 0.2-1
- Games show the material score: the pieces each side is up by and "+N".
- Chat lines show the time they arrived.
- The About page shows the package version.

* Fri Sep 11 2026 van-ess0 <https://github.com/van-ess0> 0.1-1
- First release: log in with Lichess, play games with friends (challenges,
  clocks, draw/takeback offers, chat) and solve puzzles (daily puzzle,
  themes, difficulty, hints).
- The login token is kept in Sailfish Secrets.
- Correspondence games show the time left for the current move.
